    title: "The Strategist",
    prompt:
      'Create a high-contrast black and white cinematic portrait with strict control over composition, pose, and object accuracy.\nCOMPOSITION (STRICT FRAME LOCK)\n\nFrame from upper chest to slightly above the head.\nMaintain clear headroom (2–5% space above hair), no head cropping.\nSubject occupies ~75% of the frame.\nCentered but with natural breathing space.\nBODY ORIENTATION (LOCKED)\n\nUpper body rotated slightly (5–10°) to the left frame.\nLeft shoulder must be clearly closer to the camera.\nTorso must show depth (not flat, not straight-on).\nSubtle diagonal perspective across chest and shoulders.\nPOSE (STRICT - THE CHESS-SET POSE)\n\nHead remains strictly locked forward-facing, looking directly at the camera. No neck tilt.\nCRUCIAL GEOMETRY: To achieve the angled body and face-forward head, the torso must not rotate more than 10 degrees, and the hand posture must not be forced.\nOne hand raised and resting naturally on the opposite (right) near the chin.\nCRITICAL FIX: For pose stability with an angled torso, the hand placement must be stable and non-strained, not a tight cross. Describe it as "hand resting naturally near the chin".\n100% Face Preservation: Strictly preserve the accurate face ID and features. Zero stylization.\nGLASSES (IMPORTANT FIX)\n\nSubject is wearing premium rectangular eyeglasses with a medium-thick black frame.\nFrame should be sharp, well-defined, not thin, not oversized.\nSubtle reflections on lenses, but eyes clearly visible.\nWATCH (STRICT ACCURACY)\n\nClassic premium analog wristwatch with a white dial.\nClean round dial with minimal subdials (chronograph style), not overly complex, not empty plain dial.\nLeather strap.\nWrist rotated outward so dial faces camera clearly.\nDial details must be crisp and realistic (markers, hands, reflections).\nLIGHTING (LOCKED)\n\nStrong Rembrandt lighting.\nKey light from one side (ideally from the left, highlighting the closer shoulder and face), slightly above eye level.\nOpposite side in deep shadow.\nClear triangular highlight under one eye.\nHigh contrast, deep blacks, no flat lighting.\nDETAIL QUALITY\n\nUltra-sharp micro details: skin texture, full groomed beard strands, hair separation, suit fabric grain.\nNo smoothing, no artificial skin.\nSTYLING\n\nDark tailored blazer.\nCrisp white shirt, slightly open collar (essential for contrast).\nPremium, clean, editorial look.\nBACKGROUND\n\nPure black seamless background.\nNo gradients, no texture.\nCAMERA\n\nSony A1, 85mm, f/1.8, ISO 100, 1/160\nSharp focus on face and watch.\nOUTPUT STYLE\n\nProfessional studio portrait, editorial quality, dramatic and premium.\nAspect ratio: 4:5',
